sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as PcView.qml / ComputerModel
    participant CM as ComputerManager
    participant MDNS as qmdnsengine
    participant HTTP as NvHTTP
    participant Pair as NvPairingManager
    participant Identity as IdentityManager
    participant Store as QSettings hosts
    participant Host as GameStream/Sunshine host

    UI->>CM: startPolling()
    CM->>MDNS: browse _nvstream._tcp.local.
    MDNS-->>CM: service discovered
    CM->>MDNS: resolve hostname and port
    CM->>HTTP: getServerInfo()
    HTTP->>Host: HTTP/HTTPS serverinfo
    Host-->>HTTP: server XML
    HTTP-->>CM: NvComputer candidate
    CM->>Store: saveHosts()
    CM-->>UI: computerStateChanged()

    UI->>CM: pairHost(computer, pin)
    CM->>Pair: pair(host, pin)
    Pair->>Identity: getSslConfig()
    Pair->>Host: getservercert, clientchallenge, serverchallenge
    Host-->>Pair: certificates and pairing challenges
    Pair->>Pair: verify cert signatures and PIN-derived challenge
    alt pair success
        Pair-->>CM: PAIRED
        CM->>Store: persist server certificate
        CM-->>UI: pairCompleted()
    else pair failure
        Pair->>Host: unpair()
        Pair-->>CM: PIN_WRONG / FAILED / ALREADY_IN_PROGRESS
        CM-->>UI: pairFailed()
    end
